<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Minijuego · Fotosíntesis</title>
  <style>
    .ova-diagram {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    }
    .ova-diagram svg path {
      fill: none;
      stroke: var(--primary);
      stroke-width: 2px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="ova-container">
    <upao-header eyebrow="MINIJUEGO" title="Fotosíntesis"></upao-header>
    <upao-objective>Al terminar podrás identificar los componentes de la fotosíntesis.</upao-objective>
    <section class="ova-card">
      <p>La fotosíntesis es el proceso por el que las plantas, algas y algunos hongos convierten la energía luminosa del sol en energía química, almacenada en moléculas como el glucosa. Este proceso se divide en dos fases principales: la fase luminosa y la fase de Calvin.</p>

      <upao-figure caption="Figura 1. Fases de la fotosíntesis"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 250">
        <path d="M50,100 Q100,20 150,100 Z" />
        <path d="M120,150 L100,230 Q100,240 110,230 L130,230" />
        <text x="100" y="70" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--text-muted)">Fase Luminosa</text>
        <text x="120" y="240" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--text-muted)">Ciclo de Calvin</text>
      </svg></upao-figure>

      <upao-drop-zone zone-id="cat_a" accepts="cat_a" label="Fase Luminosa"></upao-drop-zone>
      <upao-drop-zone zone-id="cat_b" accepts="cat_b" label="Ciclo de Calvin"></upao-drop-zone>

      <upao-drag-item item-id="item1" category="cat_a">Fotossíntesis</upao-drag-item>
      <upao-drag-item item-id="item2" category="cat_a">ATP y NADPH</upao-drag-item>
      <upao-drag-item item-id="item3" category="cat_b">Calvin Cycle</upao-drag-item>
      <upao-drag-item item-id="item4" category="cat_b">CO2</upao-drag-item>

      <upao-complete label="Continuar →" locked require-progress="2"></upao-complete>
    </section>
    <div class="ova-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span style="width:0%"></span></div>
    <p id="estado" aria-live="polite" class="ova-muted"></p>
    <button class="ova-btn" id="finalizar" disabled>Finalizar actividad</button>
  </main>
  <script>
    const dragItems = ['item1', 'item2', 'item3', 'item4'];
    const dropZones = ['cat_a', 'cat_b'];

    function updateProgress() {
      const progress = document.querySelector('.ova-progress span');
      progress.style.width = `${(dragItems.filter(item => document.getElementById(item).parentElement.getAttribute('zone-id') === dropZones[0]).length + dragItems.filter(item => document.getElementById(item).parentElement.getAttribute('zone-id') === dropZones[1]).length) / dragItems.length * 100}%`;
    }

    dragItems.forEach(item => {
      document.getElementById(item).addEventListener('dragstart', () => {
        document.getElementById(item).style.opacity = '0.4';
      });
      document.getElementById(item).addEventListener('dragend', () => {
        document.getElementById(item).style.opacity = '1';
      });
      dropZones.forEach(zone => {
        document.getElementById(zone).addEventListener('dragover', (e) => {
          e.preventDefault();
        }, false);
        document.getElementById(zone).addEventListener('drop', (e) => {
          e.preventDefault();
          document.getElementById(item).parentElement = document.getElementById(zone);
          updateProgress();
        });
      });
    });

    document.getElementById('finalizar').addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (document.getElementById('cat_a').children.length === 2 && document.getElementById('cat_b').children.length === 2) {
        document.getElementById('estado').textContent = '✓ Actividad completada';
        _scormComplete();
      }
    });
  </script>
  <script>function _scormInit(){if(window.API)window.API.LMSInitialize("")}function _scormComplete(s){if(window.API){if(s!=null)window.API.LMSSetValue("cmi.core.score.raw",s);window.API.LMSSetValue("cmi.core.lesson_status","completed");window.API.LMSCommit("");window.API.LMSFinish("")}}window.addEventListener("load",_scormInit)</script>
</body>
</html>
